  {
   "id": "sec1-1",
   "section": "History",
   "text": "L'Insoumission Hebdo was created in 1979 as a weekly ecosocialist newspaper, it was founded by Jean-Luc Mélenchon, member of Socialist Party and future founder of La France Insoumise.",
